p;&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 무논문과정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;1) 산업대학원 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5학기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;2) 교육대학원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4학기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2) 컨설팅대학원 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4학기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 시험과목 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 20.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp; 가. 석사 과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3과목</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 박사 과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 4과목</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 응시 과목 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">동일교수의 과목만으로 시행할 수 없으며,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;석․박사과정 모두 문제출제 교수가 반드시 2명 이상이어야 함<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(박사 응시생의 경우 A교수:2과목/B교수:2과목=&gt;가능<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A교수:3과목/B교수:1과목=&gt;불가능)<br>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ 졸업종합시험 응시과목은 학차에 따라 한 과목씩 따로&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;응시할 수 없으며, 석사 3과목 이상․박사 4과목 이상<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;해당과목을&nbsp;일괄적으로 응시하여야 함</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(단, 응시과목 중 불합격한 과목에 대해서는 한 과목 응시 가능함)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 시험시간</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 석사과정 : 19:00 ~ 21:30 [150분]</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 박사과정 : 19:00 ~ 22:20 [200분]</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 시험 과목 및 장소</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 추후 공지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2011. 09.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMI